                                                "sense_id": "a81cdd93-2ea2-3a20-b20f-d5fb93d59204",
                                                "text": "Stephanie (Irene Dunne): Oh, yes. I like the English. And the Americans, too! / John Kent (Randolph Scott): Gee, that's swell. I'm an American! / Stephanie: Gee, that's swe–, I mean, I thought so."
                                            }
