                                                "sense_id": "e8e5b7a1-6e2a-3b3e-8ebe-5e72d1fe649b",
                                                "text": "I did use a few of the items, in Elinor's handwriting, to check the writing on the letter that was in the box with the money. It geed."
                                            }
